7. **Pending Tasks**:
   - Mark Not tests with appropriate TODO/SKIP blocks for known differences
   - Implement execute() for PreIncrement node
   - Implement execute() for PostIncrement node
   - Implement execute() for PreDecrement node
   - Implement execute() for PostDecrement node
   - Implement execute() for Loop node
