   - Run all tests and verify passing

8. **Current Work**:
   Immediately before the summary request, I was attempting to update the Not operator tests in `t/sea-of-nodes/interpreter-differential.t` to mark known semantic differences with TODO and SKIP blocks. The test results showed:
   - 2 tests passing (Not false cases)
